# AXIS CELL: scrutinee type = ENUM with COMPLETE top-level variant coverage but
# a REFUTABLE NESTED sub-pattern x consumer = the `safety_commit` JOIN in
# `check_safety_stmt`'s `SMatch` arm. Its divergence-gate twin is
# `match_nested_refutable_diverge_use_after_move_reject.gg`.
#
# `Outer.Wrap` and `Outer.Nil` are every variant of `Outer`, but the `Wrap` arm
# only matches when the payload is `Inner.Red()`. `main` passes
# `Outer.Wrap(Inner.Blue())`, so control falls out of the match with `s` still
# moved and `print(s)` is a use-after-move -- rejected by `gg check` with
# `error[E_UseAfterMove]`.
#
# ⚠ SPELLING IS LOAD-BEARING: every top-level arm is a QUALIFIED USER-enum
# constructor, and no prelude variant (`Some`/`None`/`Ok`/`Error`) appears in a
# top-level arm pattern. `tests/fixtures/self_host_typechecker/parser.gg` -- the
# copy the typechecker and lowerer share; `self_host_parser/` and
# `self_host_resolver/` carry their own -- lowers `None` and `None()` to
# `PLiteral(ENoneLiteral)`, NOT `PConstructor` (the `KW_NONE` branch runs before
# the constructor branch), so an `Option[T]` spelling of this shape is INVISIBLE
# to the syntactic one-bit proxy used in the RED-verification break below and
# would leave the cell green under its own break. Two earlier measurements of
# this cell silently substituted user enums for exactly this reason.
#
# ⚠ NOTE what this cell does NOT claim: it is not a guard against the
# typechecker's exhaustiveness verdict being WRONG here. That verdict credits
# `Outer.Wrap(Inner.Red())` as full coverage of `Outer.Wrap`, faithfully to Rust
# and faithfully to a filed Core #8 wrong-accept (`TODO.md`, the entry beginning
# "`collect_covered_variants` counts a REFUTABLE NESTED SUB-PATTERN"). What the
# cell guards is that the MOVE CHECKER never consults that verdict.
#
# RED-VERIFY (fuse the verdict into the classifier's BODY): give
# `match_has_catch_all` a second `return true` for the case "every unguarded arm
# is a `PConstructor`/`PDotShorthand`" -- signature unchanged, conservative tail
# `return false` still present, none of `ctx`/`types`/`exhaust` mentioned, every
# call site untouched -- so `cargo test --test lints
# self_host_match_fallthrough_predicates_pinned` stays GREEN under it. Rebuild
# the driver. Measured: this cell flips rc 1 -> rc 0, 6476 bytes of C, while
# `s5_join_int_nonexh.gg` stays GREEN -- which is the whole reason both cells
# ship.
enum Inner:
    Red()
    Blue()

enum Outer:
    Wrap(Inner)
    Nil()

void sink(String ^x):
    pass

void probe(Outer o):
    String s = "hello"
    sink(^s)
    match o:
        case Outer.Wrap(Inner.Red()):
            s = "a"
        case Outer.Nil():
            s = "b"
    print(s)

void main():
    probe(Outer.Wrap(Inner.Blue()))
